  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parsing-main-inhead\n\nUnder *A start tag whose tag name is \"template\"*, otherwise -> step 8.1, it says:\n\n> [Attach a shadow root](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attach-a-shadow-root) with declarative shadow host element, mode, clonable, serializable, delegatesFocus, \"named\", and registry.\n\nHowever, no variable named `registry` is defined earlier in the algorithm.\n\ncc: @annevk ",
